                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ermergersh... I wanna be the very best, like no one ever was! I'm gonna be the Pong Champion!..\nThis game is pretty rad, the controls are easy, there are several different difficulties (which are actually realistic, in that the beginner mode is pretty easy, but the intermediate mode was hard enough to give me a challenge, and the expert mode was tough enough that it'd take me some serious training to win a match).  The modeling is nice, and the physics are the most realistic of any ping pong game I've played, I mean, you can actually put some heavy spin on the ball.  The only thing I wish was a little better is the tracking on the opponent's paddle, sometimes it seems a far stretch that they'd be able to return a fast spike from the resting paddle position.\n\nThat being said, this game is about as close to real ping pong as I can get, without standing behind an actual table. Would definitely recommend.\n",
